# MapVote Panorama

Read and follow these before editing HUD or image tooling:

- [workshop/AGENTS.md](workshop/AGENTS.md) — server can only dialog vars + SetHasClass; image class palettes; layout table
- [workshop/panorama-css.md](workshop/panorama-css.md) — CSS subset and layout traps
- [stuff/PANORAMA_RULESET.md](stuff/PANORAMA_RULESET.md) — engine binding ruleset

Run `make panorama` after XML/CSS changes. Layout edits require a workshop addon republish.
